  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「う～っ、寒ぶ寒ぶ寒ぶ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「こう冷えこむと堪んね～よ、ったくよぉ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「あぁもう、関節がミシミシいってやがる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「けっきょくクリスマスんときの雪合戦は不戦敗みたいな感じになっちまって、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「グラウンドの雪かきさせられたからなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「ついでに、家でも雪かきにくわえて年末の大掃除までやらされて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「そんなもん、元気が有り余ってる兄キどもがやりゃいいのに。力仕事させんじゃね～よ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「あいつら、あたしが女の子だってこと忘れてんじゃね～のか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「ひどい筋肉痛になっちまって、年末年始は強制的に寝正月だよこの野郎。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「けっきょく初詣にくんのも遅れちまったなぁ。もう、正月どころか三が日も終わってんじゃね～か」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「まぁ『初めて詣でる』のが『初詣』なんだから、構わね～んだろうけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「ん～。さすがに、この時期だと神社も閑散としてんのな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「誰もいない神社って、ちょっと不気味だな……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「ううっ、ぞっとしね～や。お参りだけして、さっさと帰ろ～っと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「……うん？　だっ、誰かいる!?　そそそ、そこにいるのは誰だっ？　出てこいっ！」"
  },
